<title>HONG KONG: SHK Hong Kong Ind 1996 net down 86 pct.</title>
<headline>SHK Hong Kong Ind 1996 net down 86 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   3.68	 vs 30.25</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	  vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  15.74 gain vs 387.34 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    61.18	vs 451.43</p>
<p>    Turnover		     62.73	vs 41.79</p>
<p>    Company name		 SHK Hong Kong Industries Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 16-22</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   April 29</p>
<p>NOTE - SHK Hong Kong Industries is an investor in Hong Kong or Macau industrial companies.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of long-term investments.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is four H.K. cents (including interim dividend of two cents) vs 12.25 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
